    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεισ-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw in a remark before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Socr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>start, make a beginning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ φόβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					22.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>supervene, come on before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὥρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					5.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
